# Everything Python in the API image (deploy/Dockerfile.azure2), installed
# with --require-hashes: the server's packages, AZURE2's build backend and
# pybind11, and pyazr's runtime dependencies (AZURE2 itself is then installed
# with --no-deps --no-build-isolation). Python 3.10, Ubuntu 22.04's, on any
# architecture. Regenerate the .txt with the command at its top.
-r ../server/requirements.txt
setuptools
pybind11
mpmath
scipy
